ackathon\',\n    status: \'BELUM_DAFTAR\',\n    regDeadline: \'2026-08-25\',\n    submitDeadline: \'2026-08-30\',\n    announcementDate: \'2026-09-02\',\n    eventDate: \'2026-09-12\',\n    organizer: \'Google Developer Student Clubs & Kominfo\',\n    details: \'Hackathon 48 jam membangun solusi GenAI & Machine Learning untuk keberlanjutan energi. Benefit: Grand prize Rp 50 Juta + Cloud credits $5,000.\',\n    driveUrl: \'\',\n    submissionUrl: \'https://hackathon-ai.id/register\',\n    documentsUrl: \'https://drive.google.com/file/d/sample-tech-stack-doc/view\',\n    year: 2026,\n    tags: [\'AI/ML\', \'48 Jam\', \'Hadiah Rp 50Jt\'],\n    createdAt: \'2026-07-20T11:00:00.000Z\',\n    updatedAt: \'2026-07-20T11:00:00.000Z\',\n  },\n  {\n    id: \'act-4\',\n    title: \'Lomba Essay Nasional Pendidikan\',\n    categoryId: \'cat-essay\',\n    status: \'SELESAI\',\n    regDeadline: \'2026-03-10\',\n    submitDeadline: \'2026-03-15\',\n    announcementDate: \'2026-03-30\',\n    eventDate: \'2026-04-05\',\n    organizer: \'HIMA Pendidikan UNY\',\n    details: \'Lomba Esai bertema \"Digitalisasi Pendidikan Daerah 3T\". Berhasil meraih Juara 2 Nasional. Benefit: Piala, Sertifikat Juara 2, Hadiah Uang Pembinaan Rp 3.000.000.\',\n    driveUrl: \'https://drive.google.com/file/d/sertifikat-juara-2-essay-uny/view\',\n    submissionUrl: \'https://bit.ly/submit-esai-uny\',\n    documentsUrl: \'https://drive.google.com/file/d/naskah-esai-final-pdf/view\',\n    year: 2026,\n    tags: [\'Juara 2\', \'Esai Nasional\', \'Pendidikan\'],\n    createdAt: \'2026-02-01T10:00:00.000Z\',\n    updatedAt: \'2026-04-06T16:00:00.000Z\',\n  },\n  {\n    id: \'act-5\',\n    title: \'Video Editing & Cinematic Short Film Festival\',\n    categoryId: \'cat-video-editing\',\n    status: \'TIDAK_LOLOS\',\n    regDeadline: \'2026-05-01\',\n    submitDeadline: \'2026-05-10\',\n    announcementDate: \'2026-05-25\',\n    eventDate: \'2026-06-01\',\n    organizer: \'Kementerian Pariwisata & Ekonomi Kreatif\