    modified_response: "I have updated the application to adopt the **Elegant Dark** design theme across all components:\n\n- **Color Palette & Contrast**: Applied deep dark backgrounds (`#09090b` for canvas, `#0c0c0e` and `#121215` for cards and modals) paired with refined `zinc-800` borders, crisp `zinc-100` headings, and muted `zinc-400` secondary text.\n- **Indigo Accents & Dark Badges**: Replaced blue highlights with vibrant indigo accents (`indigo-600` primary buttons, `indigo-400` icon highlights) and dark-tinted badge overlays for status tags and category badges.\n- **Table & Filter Overhaul**: Updated `ActivityTable` with dark search inputs, styled filter dropdowns, custom row hover states (`hover:bg-zinc-800/40`), and dark action buttons.\n- **Modal Containers**: Styled `ActivityFormModal`, `ActivityDetailModal`, `CategoryManagerModal`, and `NextjsPrismaView` with dark backdrop blurs, dark inputs, dark status selector panels, and consistent typography."
    thinking_duration {
      nanos: 229013394
    }
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
  }
